provision_adb.description:
First enable **ADB Debugging** on the Fire TV (Settings > My Fire TV > Developer Options). The first time you connect, accept the authorization dialog on the TV, then submit again.

These broker settings are sent to the app so you never type them on the TV. Use an **existing** broker username/password — Home Assistant can't create accounts on your broker. Default port is 1883 (8883 with TLS).

